[32m+[m[32m        units: the gold stage stores no `r_unit`/`e_unit` fields, so this[m
[32m+[m[32m            defaults to the project units (kcal/mol, Angstrom) that[m
[32m+[m[32m            `validate_sample` enforces at the silver step. Passed explicitly[m
[32m+[m[32m            only if a future source arrives in something else - MAE in the[m
[32m+[m[32m            wrong unit is wrong by a silent constant factor rather than[m
[32m+[m[32m            visibly broken (CLAUDE.md).[m
[32m+[m[32m    """[m
